+MT8183 Kukui Krane (Lenovo IdeaPad Duet)
+M:	Weijie Gao <weijie.gao@mediatek.com>
+M:	Igor Belwon <igor.belwon@mentallysanemainliners.org>
+S:	Maintained
+F:	configs/mt8183_kukui_krane_defconfig
